        </p>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;font-size:12.5px;">
          <a href="/privacy" style="color:#5C554E;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;transition:color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#11100F'" onmouseout="this.style.color='#5C554E'">Privacy Policy</a>
